     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "受命組建 Armia „Karpaty”",
      "en": "Given the Karpaty Army"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "波蘭國家記憶研究院（IPN）的九月戰役專題稱，組建 Armia „Karpaty”（喀爾巴阡軍）的命令於1939年7月11日下達，受命者是原任利沃夫的軍監（inspektor armii）、師級上將（gen. dyw.）卡齊米日·法布里齊。該軍的任務是在喀爾巴阡山區防衛國家南部邊界。美國陸軍戰史（DA Pam 20-255，Kennedy）也寫到，喀爾巴阡軍在法布里齊少將（Maj. Gen.）麾下組成，用以防衛波蘭南部邊界。",
      "en": "The IPN's September 1939 portal states that the order creating Armia „Karpaty” was issued on 11 July 1939 to the army inspector in Lwów, Maj. Gen. Kazimierz Fabrycy, with the task of defending the southern border of the state in the Carpathians. The US Army study DA Pam 20-255 likewise says the Carpathian Army was formed under Maj. Gen. K. Fabrycy to defend Poland's southern frontier."
     },
